      "background": "",
      "content": "<p style=\"max-width:20rem\">\n    An illustrated guide to restoring\n    a)—what?—some flowers soon? or \n    b) an errorless Internet (somewhere where living together <em>is</em>) or \n    c) a pathology of forgetting machines or \n    d) an imaginary garden with real networks in it, or \n    e) a herbal of exsanguine causes or \n    f) an intersubjective encyclopedia or \n    g) an \"action désorganisé et plan du monde\" or \n    h) an ark for hypercards or \n    i) a returned Promise for what is the opposite of an engineer? or \n    j) an enfilade of hearts or \n    k) a howto for a grammar of 'mixed-analogical reasoning' or \n    l) a zoology of the marked-bad sectors of a knowledge or \n    m) an overload of overloads, in lieu of furies\n</p>\n<p>\n    <a href=\"/random\"><em>Open</em> &hellip; </a><br/>\n</p>",
